      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I like the idea of a sound bubble or even just a simple adjustable sound radius settings. Some worlds are too busy and its hard to hear especial language exchange worlds. So being able to adjust for your group would be nice. Even if its just increasing the sound fall off would be nice maybe 2 sliders one for hear distance and the other for fall off distance as you might want to hear outside the bubble but not have it overpower the people you are talking too.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
