  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2021-02-19T12:09:32.713Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The idea itself is pretty simple - being able to either whisper (talking to only one person/chosen people) or making a whisper bubble (anyone in that bubble would be able to hear you). I saw the whisper bubble idea in NeosVR and I feel like this would be great for VRC as I feel that it needs something like this",
